One solution I've seen:  try the rpc_ns_binding_import_begin/next/done
loop; if you didn't get a valid binding handle, use 
rpc_ns_mgmt_handle_set_exp_age(h, 0, *st) to bypass the CDS cache,
then retry the rpc_ns_binding_import_begin/next/done loop.  In the
normal case, you expect a cache hit; for stale cache data, you go the
slower route to access a CDS server.
